msgstr "通过 {driver} 驱动，用于 {what}。"

msgid "By the {driver} driver."
msgstr "通过 {driver} 驱动。"

msgid "Check it's the commit you mean."
msgstr "请确认这是你想要的提交。"

msgid "Check that it reads its data, and restore a backup if it won't."
msgstr "请检查它能否读取数据，如无法读取，请恢复备份。"

msgid "Check that it will before you apply, and restore a backup if it won't."
msgstr "请在应用前检查，如无法读取，请恢复备份。"

msgid "Check that the app reads its data, and if it doesn't, restore {which}, from {when}."
msgstr "请检查应用能否读取数据，如不能，请恢复 {which}，创建于 {when}。"

msgid "Check that the app reads its data, and restore a backup of your own if it doesn't."
msgstr "请检查应用能否读取数据，如果不能，请恢复你自己的备份。"

msgid "Check that the app reads its data, and restore the backup taken first if it doesn't."
msgstr "请检查应用能否读取数据，如不能，请恢复事先创建的备份。"

msgid "Check that the app reads its data."
msgstr "请检查应用能否读取数据。"

msgid "Check that you have another way in, such as your provider's console, before you apply it."
msgstr "应用前，请确认你还有其他登录途径，例如服务商的控制台。"

#. placeholder {0}: server.serverName
msgid "Deny everything else closes what no rule lets in on {0}"
msgstr "拒绝其他一切流量会关闭 {0} 上没有规则放行的端口"

msgid "Deny everything else drops the tunnel's next handshake, and SSH over it with it, though it passes the test while the tunnel is up."
msgstr "“拒绝其他所有流量”会丢弃隧道的下一次握手，经隧道的 SSH 也随之中断，尽管隧道连通时测试仍会通过。"

msgid "Dependency links"
msgstr "依赖链接"

msgid "Deploy {writtenBy} first, or restore a dump instead."
msgstr "请先部署 {writtenBy} 再恢复，或者改为恢复转储。"

msgid "Docker cleanup permanently removes the selected Docker artifacts"
msgstr "Docker 清理将永久删除所选 Docker 对象"

msgid "Dockwell couldn't list the repository's branches and tags"
msgstr "Dockwell 无法列出该仓库的分支和标签"

msgid "Dockwell didn't make that network, and it reaches past the server's firewall. Whatever else is on it, other projects' services too, can reach {name}, and it them."
msgstr "该网络不是 Dockwell 创建的，并且可以绕过服务器的防火墙。网络上的其他内容（包括其他项目的服务）都能访问 {name}，它也能访问它们。"

msgid "Dockwell didn't make that network. Whatever else is on it, other projects' services too, can reach {name}, and it them."
msgstr "该网络不是 Dockwell 创建的。网络上的其他内容（包括其他项目的服务）都能访问 {name}，它也能访问它们。"

msgid "Dockwell didn't make that volume, and won't delete it. Whatever else mounts it shares what it holds."
msgstr "该卷不是 Dockwell 创建的，Dockwell 也不会删除它。其他挂载它的容器会共享其中的内容。"

msgid "Dockwell keeps it whole, so undo puts it back."
msgstr "Dockwell 会完整保留它，撤销即可恢复。"

msgid "Dockwell moves it as {branch} moved."
msgstr "{branch} 有了新提交，Dockwell 随之移动了它。"

msgid "Don't start its Compose project again."
msgstr "不要再次启动它的 Compose 项目。"

msgid "Don't write a secret in a variable's name."
msgstr "不要把机密写在变量名中。"

msgid "Each keeps running as it is."
msgstr "它们会照常运行。"

msgid "Everything in {name} on {server} goes back to what was there before the restore"
msgstr "{server} 上 {name} 的全部内容会回到恢复之前的状态"

msgid "Files changed as they were read, so it can hold half a write, and the app may not start from it."
msgstr "文件在读取时发生了变化，因此可能包含写到一半的内容，应用可能无法从中启动。"

msgid "Fills {name} on {server} with the copy from {taken}"
msgstr "用 {taken} 的副本填充 {server} 上的 {name}"

msgid "Follows {branch}: Dockwell moves the catalog along it, by changes you can undo."
msgstr "跟随 {branch}：Dockwell 会随它移动目录，每次都是可以撤销的变更。"

msgid "For {what}."
msgstr "用于 {what}。"

msgid "Give it one, such as {target}:size=64m, or give {name} a memory limit."
msgstr "请设置大小，例如 {target}:size=64m，或者为 {name} 设置内存上限。"

msgid "Health checks pause. Routes lose their backend. Apps that use this workload may lose access."
msgstr "健康检查将暂停，路由将没有可用的后端。依赖此工作负载的应用可能无法访问它。"

msgid "Health checks resume and routes can serve the workload again. Dependent apps keep running."
msgstr "健康检查将恢复，路由可重新转发流量。依赖此工作负载的应用继续运行。"

msgid "If a backup fails, the upgrade stops there, with nothing else done. Undoing this puts the old version back, but not what the new one changed in its data: restore the backup for that."
msgstr "如果备份失败，升级会就此停止，不做其他操作。撤销会恢复旧版本，但不会恢复新版本对数据的改动：如需恢复数据，请恢复备份。"

msgid "If it's a secret, set it in environment for the app to read instead."
msgstr "如果它是机密，请改为在 environment 中设置，让应用从那里读取。"

msgid "If that isn't what you meant, change name: in the file to give it a project of its own."
msgstr "如果这不是你的本意，请修改文件中的 name:，让它有自己的项目。"

msgid "If your address isn't one of these, or stops being one, SSH closes to you, and no timer catches that later."
msgstr "如果你的地址不在其中，或以后不再是其中之一，SSH 就会对你关闭，而且之后没有计时器能发现这一点。"

msgid "If {name} is rolled back, {names} stays as it is: what the new version writes there isn't undone."
msgstr "如果回滚 {name}，{names} 会保持原样：新版本写入的内容不会被撤销。"

msgid "Installed apps don't change. An upgrade is a plan you apply."
msgstr "已安装的应用不会变。升级是由你应用的计划。"

msgid "Installs of them keep running, with no upgrades."
msgstr "已安装的会继续运行，但不再有升级。"

#. placeholder {0}: detected.packages(d).join("; ")
msgid "Installs {0}."
msgstr "安装 {0}。"

msgid "It bans any other address that keeps failing to sign in, yours included."
msgstr "其他任何多次登录失败的地址都会被它封禁，包括你的地址。"

msgid "It came from the Compose project {project}. Until Dockwell changes its image, whatever runs that acts on this container. After that, starting the project again starts a second copy, on the same folders and under the same name. If a panel or a script runs it, find out what its remove does to {where} before you use it, as it may delete what this service mounts. If you ran docker compose yourself, don't run that file again."
msgstr "它来自 Compose 项目 {project}。在 Dockwell 更换它的镜像之前，运行该项目的工具会作用于这个容器。更换之后，再次启动该项目会启动第二个副本，使用相同的目录和相同的名称。如果是面板或脚本在运行它，使用其移除功能之前，请先弄清楚这会对 {where} 做什么，因为它可能会删除此服务挂载的内容。如果是你自己运行的 docker compose，请不要再运行那个文件。"

msgid "It can read and write that path on the server."
msgstr "它可以读写服务器上的该路径。"

msgid "It can read that path on the server."
msgstr "它可以读取服务器上的该路径。"

msgid "It can take half the server's memory."
msgstr "它最多可以占用服务器一半的内存。"

msgid "It can write to <0>{holder}</0>, which holds <1>{held}</1>, which it mounts as well. So it can turn that into a link to anywhere on the server, which it follows when it next starts. That's as good as root, so from now on any change to {name} but another tag asks for a passkey."
msgstr "它可以写入包含 <1>{held}</1> 的 <0>{holder}</0>，而它自己也挂载了 <1>{held}</1>。所以它能把它改成指向服务器上任意位置的链接，下次启动时就会跟随该链接。这相当于拥有 root，所以从现在起，对 {name} 的任何更改（另一个标签除外）都需要通行密钥。"

msgid "It can write to <0>{holder}</0>, which holds <1>{held}</1>, which {holdsFor} mounts. So it can turn that into a link to anywhere on the server, which {holdsFor} follows when it next starts. That's as good as root, so from now on any change to {name} but another tag asks for a passkey."
msgstr "它可以写入包含 <1>{held}</1> 的 <0>{holder}</0>，而 {holdsFor} 挂载了 <1>{held}</1>。所以它能把它改成指向服务器上任意位置的链接，{holdsFor} 下次启动时就会跟随该链接。这相当于拥有 root，所以从现在起，对 {name} 的任何更改（另一个标签除外）都需要通行密钥。"

msgid "It can write to {holder}, which holds {held}, which it mounts as well."
msgstr "它可以写入 {holder}，其中有 {held}，而它自己也挂载了 {held}。"

msgid "It can write to {holder}, which holds {held}, which {holdsFor} mounts."
msgstr "它可以写入 {holder}，其中有 {held}，而 {holdsFor} 挂载了 {held}。"

msgid "It can't be read meanwhile, and it goes once the server is back and the 7 days are up."
msgstr "在此期间无法读取；服务器恢复连接且满 7 天后，这些日志会被删除。"

msgid "It closes {closes}: add a rule for any you mean to keep open."
msgstr "它会关闭 {closes}：要保持开放的，请为其添加规则。"

msgid "It has the Linux capability <0>{path}</0>, which is the same as root."
msgstr "它拥有 Linux 能力 <0>{path}</0>，相当于 root。"

msgid "It isn't in a volume Dockwell made. Undoing this puts the old release back, not what the new one changed in its data."
msgstr "它的数据不在 Dockwell 创建的卷中。撤销会放回旧版本，但不会恢复新版本对数据所做的更改。"

msgid "It joins the group <0>{path}</0>, which is the same as root."
msgstr "它加入用户组 <0>{path}</0>，相当于 root。"

msgid "It leads to <0>{leadsTo}</0> through a symlink, and the server's security rests on what is there, so reaching it is as good as root."
msgstr "它通过符号链接指向 <0>{leadsTo}</0>，而服务器的安全取决于那里的内容，所以能访问它就相当于拥有 root。"

msgid "It may be an older commit, or a fork's."
msgstr "它可能是较早的提交，或来自某个分叉。"

msgid "It never bans the server itself or the control server."
msgstr "它不会封禁服务器自身和控制服务器。"

msgid "It never bans {never}."
msgstr "它永不封禁 {never}。"

msgid "It never bans {never}. {counts} {lifting}"
msgstr "它永不封禁 {never}。{counts}{lifting}"

msgid "It opens {opening}. A token can keep out more, and only a person lets anyone in."
msgstr "它会开放{opening}。令牌可以挡住更多人，只有人工批准才能放人进来。"

msgid "It reaches what the server reaches, past Docker's network and the firewall."
msgstr "它能访问服务器能访问的一切，绕过 Docker 网络和防火墙。"

msgid "It runs in privileged mode, which gives it every device and capability on the server."
msgstr "它以特权模式运行，可使用服务器上的所有设备和能力。"

msgid "It runs on its schedule, and whenever someone runs it now. Whatever it runs, it runs with everything root can do there."
msgstr "它按计划运行，也会在有人立即运行时运行。无论运行什么，它都拥有 root 在那里的全部权限。"

msgid "It runs through the Compose project {project}. Until Dockwell changes its image, anything done to it in 1Panel acts on this container. After that, 1Panel shows it in error, as it can't find the container. Leave that as it is: Start, Rebuild, Upgrade or editing its settings there starts a second copy, on the same folders and under the same name. Don't uninstall it in 1Panel, at either point: that deletes {where}, which holds what this service mounts."
msgstr "它通过 Compose 项目 {project} 运行。在 Dockwell 更换它的镜像之前，在 1Panel 中对它的任何操作都会作用于这个容器。更换之后，1Panel 会显示它出错，因为找不到这个容器。不要理会这个状态：在那里启动、重建、升级或编辑其设置都会启动第二个副本，使用相同的目录和相同的名称。无论何时都不要在 1Panel 中卸载它：那会删除 {where}，其中保存着此服务挂载的内容。"

msgid "It runs through the Compose project {project}. Until Dockwell changes its image, what you do to it in {tool} acts on this container. After that, starting or redeploying it there can start a second copy, on the same folders and under the same name. Before you remove it there, find out what that does to {where}, as it may delete what this service mounts."
msgstr "它通过 Compose 项目 {project} 运行。在 Dockwell 更换它的镜像之前，你在 {tool} 中的操作会作用于这个容器。更换之后，在那里启动或重新部署可能会启动第二个副本，使用相同的目录和相同的名称。在那里移除它之前，请先弄清楚这会对 {where} 做什么，因为它可能会删除此服务挂载的内容。"

msgid "It runs with <0>{path}</0>, which is the same as root."
msgstr "它以 <0>{path}</0> 运行，这等同于 root。"

msgid "It sees and signals every process on the server."
msgstr "它能看到并向服务器上的每个进程发送信号。"

msgid "It takes that proxy's word for where a request came from."
msgstr "它会相信该代理所说的请求来源。"

msgid "It takes that proxy's word for where a request came from. Whatever else is in that range can reach the route, and say who its client is."
msgstr "它会相信该代理所说的请求来源。该范围内的其他任何东西都能访问这条路由，并声称其客户端是谁。"

msgid "It took too long to measure. If an hour is too short, this stops there, with nothing else done."
msgstr "测量耗时过长。如果一小时不够，操作会在此停止，其他内容都不会改动。"

msgid "It uses the device <0>{path}</0>, which is the same as root."
msgstr "它使用设备 <0>{path}</0>，这等同于 root。"

msgid "Its agent is refused from then on."
msgstr "此后它的代理会被拒绝。"

msgid "Its apps leave the catalog"
msgstr "它的应用将离开应用目录"

msgid "Its environment comes into Dockwell with it, sealed. No plan or log shows a value of it, and it keeps running."
msgstr "它的环境变量会加密后一同进入 Dockwell。任何计划或日志都不会显示其值，容器也会继续运行。"

msgid "Its last reading says so. Applying this stops before it moves, with nothing changed."
msgstr "这是它最近一次读数显示的。应用此更改会在迁移前停止，不做任何更改。"

msgid "Its volumes are backed up first"
msgstr "它的卷会先备份"

msgid "Keep a rule that allows the tunnel's UDP port."
msgstr "请保留一条允许隧道 UDP 端口的规则。"

msgid "Keeps its identity and files."
msgstr "保留容器标识和文件。"

msgid "Labels alone: no step runs on {on}, online or offline."
msgstr "仅改标签：{on} 上不会运行任何步骤，无论在线与否。"

msgid "Leave it alone in 1Panel from now on, and never uninstall it there."
msgstr "从现在起不要在 1Panel 中操作它，也绝不要在那里卸载它。"

msgid "Leave it alone in {tool} from now on."
msgstr "从现在起不要在 {tool} 中操作它。"

msgid "Leaves out {file}"
msgstr "不收录 {file}"

msgid "Loads the dump from {taken} into {name} on {server}"
msgstr "把 {taken} 的转储加载到 {server} 上的 {name}"

msgid "Lower its feature compatibility version to {to} first if it's higher."
msgstr "如果它的功能兼容版本更高，请先降到 {to}。"

msgid "Lower its feature compatibility version to {to} first."
msgstr "请先把它的功能兼容版本降到 {to}。"

msgid "MongoDB moves only from data at the release it leaves, so its feature compatibility version goes up to {from} first, and its data may then use {from}'s features."
msgstr "MongoDB 只能从与当前版本一致的数据迁移，因此它的功能兼容版本会先提升到 {from}，此后它的数据可能用到 {from} 的功能。"

msgid "More than one container answers to {shared} on {network}"
msgstr "在 {network} 上有多个容器响应 {shared}"

msgid "Moves {names} on, which an install of each can upgrade to."
msgstr "更新 {names}，已安装的实例可以升级到新版本。"

msgid "Name a network the proxy has to itself."
msgstr "请指定一个由该代理独占的网络。"

msgid "No backup is taken first"
msgstr "升级前不会创建备份"

msgid "No backup was taken, and the data stays as it is now"
msgstr "没有做过备份,数据保持现状"

msgid "No branch or tag is at this commit now"
msgstr "当前没有分支或标签指向这个提交"

#. placeholder {0}: note.names.join(", ")
msgid "No clear answer for {0}"
msgstr "{0} 没有明确的结果"

msgid "No login or address limit found on the old proxy"
msgstr "在旧代理上未发现登录或地址限制"

#. placeholder {0}: server.serverName
msgid "No rule allows the WireGuard tunnel {tunnels} on {0}"
msgstr "{0} 上没有规则允许 WireGuard 隧道 {tunnels}"

msgid "Nothing installed from this catalog upgrades to them."
msgstr "从此目录安装的应用不会升级到它们。"

msgid "Pulls {image} again, and replaces {name} only if that's a newer image."
msgstr "将重新拉取 {image}，只有镜像更新时才会替换 {name}。"

msgid "Pulls {image} again, and replaces {name} whatever that finds, as more than its image differs."
msgstr "重新拉取 {image}，并且无论结果如何都会替换 {name}，因为不只是镜像有差异。"

msgid "Pulls {image} again, and replaces {name} with what that names now, in place of the digest it's pinned to."
msgstr "重新拉取 {image}，并用它现在指向的内容替换 {name}，不再固定于原来的摘要。"

msgid "Railpack says: {warning}"
msgstr "Railpack 提示：{warning}"

msgid "Read it for the rest before you pass one a secret."
msgstr "在向其中传入密钥之前，请先阅读文件中的其余部分。"

msgid "Replaces {name} on {server} with the copy from {taken}"
msgstr "用 {taken} 的副本替换 {server} 上的 {name}"

msgid "Replaces {name} on {server} with the dump from {taken}"
msgstr "用 {taken} 的转储替换 {server} 上的 {name}"

msgid "Restarts only container {id} on this server"
msgstr "仅重启此服务器上的容器 {id}"

msgid "Restore {which}, from {when}, from Backups after this."
msgstr "完成后请在“备份”中恢复 {which}，创建于 {when}。"

msgid "Revision {revision} ran different images of {image} on each server, so {name} runs what {image} is now"
msgstr "修订版本 {revision} 在各服务器上运行的 {image} 镜像不同，因此 {name} 将运行 {image} 当前指向的镜像"

msgid "Routes"
msgstr "路由"

msgid "Run it again once it's back."
msgstr "它恢复连接后请再运行一次。"

msgid "Run it again once they're back."
msgstr "它们恢复连接后请再运行一次。"

#. placeholder {0}: server.serverName
msgid "SSH on {0} stays open from nowhere"
msgstr "{0} 上的 SSH 不再对任何地址开放"

#. placeholder {0}: server.serverName
msgid "SSH on {0} stays open only from {from}"
msgstr "{0} 上的 SSH 只对 {from} 开放"

msgid "Something may still manage {container}"
msgstr "可能还有其他工具在管理 {container}"

msgid "Starts on every placed server"
msgstr "在部署此工作负载的所有服务器上启动"

msgid "Stops following its branch, and stays at this commit until you move it."
msgstr "不再跟随分支，停留在此提交，直到你移动它。"

msgid "Stops on every placed server"
msgstr "在部署此工作负载的所有服务器上停止"

msgid "Take out the range that covers everything for it to ban anyone."
msgstr "去掉覆盖所有地址的范围，它才能封禁任何人。"

msgid "Takes away {names}"
msgstr "移除 {names}"

msgid "Takes {ids} from another catalog"
msgstr "从另一个目录接管 {ids}"

msgid "That goes beyond what Docker gives a container by default."
msgstr "这超出了 Docker 默认给容器的权限。"

msgid "That goes beyond what Docker keeps for it."
msgstr "这超出了 Docker 为它保留的范围。"

msgid "That is the same as root if it is the group that owns Docker's socket on the server."
msgstr "如果它是服务器上拥有 Docker 套接字的用户组，就相当于 root。"

msgid "That is the server itself, past its containers, at {at} over plain HTTP."
msgstr "这是服务器本身，绕过其容器，通过明文 HTTP 位于 {at}。"

